# GameVault

GameVault is a full-stack MERN application that helps users discover PC game deals and share reviews with the community.

## Features

- Browse PC game deals using the CheapShark API
- Search for games by title
- View detailed information about each game
- Read community reviews
- Create reviews
- Edit reviews
- Delete reviews
- Responsive layout for desktop and mobile

## Technologies Used

### Frontend

- React
- React Router
- Axios
- CSS

### Backend

- Node.js
- Express
- MongoDB
- Mongoose

## Installation

### Backend

```bash
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev
```

### Frontend

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

## API Used

CheapShark API

https://www.cheapshark.com/api

